# Strategy Intelligence Engine v2: Comprehensive Upgrade

## Background & Problem Statement

The current strategy building system in StockScout is functional but has significant gaps when compared to institutional-grade portfolio construction frameworks. Based on my analysis of the existing codebase and extensive research into academic best practices (multi-factor portfolio construction, regime-aware investing, systematic entry/exit frameworks), I've identified these key shortcomings:

### Current System Limitations

| Area | Current State | Gap |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Strategy Creation** | AI chat → static JSON filters + weights | No macro/news awareness, no regime sensitivity, no future outlook |
| **Stock Selection** | Min-Max normalized composite score | No quality/momentum/value factor blending, no sector rotation logic |
| **Risk Management** | Static `stop_loss_pct` and `take_profit_pct` fields exist but are *never used* anywhere | No ATR-based stops, no trailing stops, no drawdown limits |
| **Rebalancing** | Calendar-based only (quarterly/monthly) | No drift-based triggers, no regime-aware rebalancing |
| **Entry/Exit Guidance** | None | No signals, no playbook, no pre-guidance for when to act |
| **Market Context** | Hardcoded `MARKET_REGIME_CONTEXT` string in prompt templates | No live data, no real macro overlay, no dynamic factor adjustment |
| **Post-Strategy Monitoring** | Basic alert service for news | No strategy health monitoring, no rebalance alerts, no drift tracking |
| **News Integration** | Sentiment score on news items, but not used in strategy creation | Not factored into stock selection or regime detection |

