#### Component 1: Live Macro Context Service

##### [NEW] [macro_context_service.py](file:///c:/Stock%20AI%20tool/backend/app/services/macro_context_service.py)

A new service that assembles **live** macro context instead of the hardcoded string. It will:

- Fetch **India VIX** from yfinance (`^INDIAVIX`)
- Pull the current **market regime** from the existing `regime_detector`
- Compute **sector momentum** (top 3 and bottom 3 sectors by 1-month return across Nifty 500)
- Compute **market breadth** (% of Nifty 500 stocks above their 200-day SMA)
- Compute **aggregate news sentiment** (average sentiment score across all recent news items)
- Return a structured `MacroContext` object used by the strategy chat and playbook generator

