#### [NEW] [strategy_monitor_service.py](file:///c:/Stock%20AI%20tool/backend/app/services/strategy_monitor_service.py)

A scheduled background service (runs daily) that for each **active** strategy:
1. Checks if any stock has hit its stop-loss or take-profit from the playbook
2. Computes portfolio drift from target weights
3. Checks if the market regime has changed since the strategy was last rebalanced
4. Generates alerts through the existing alert system when action is needed

